>> title: Tom Kha Gai
>> category: Soups
>> tags: chicken, coconut, thai, stovetop
>> counters: Thai Kitchen
>> aka: tom kha, tom kha kai, coconut chicken soup, coconut galangal soup, Thai coconut soup
>> pairs-with: coconut-rice
>> servings: 4
>> time: 35 min
>> step.1: simmer 10 min
>> step.2: poach 5 min
>> step.3: season off the heat
>> step.4: scatter on top

Simmer @coconut milk{2%cans}(13.5 oz each) for ~{10%min} with @galangal{6%slices}(fresh or frozen; not ginger), @lemongrass{2%stalks}(bruised and cut into lengths), and @makrut lime leaves{6}(torn).

Poach @&(~1)broth{} for ~{5%min} with @chicken stock{1%cup}(240 mL), @chicken breast{1%lb}(450 g; thinly sliced), and @straw mushrooms{1%cup}(drained).

Season @&(~1)soup{} off the heat with @fish sauce{3%Tbs}, @lime juice{3%Tbs}, and @palm sugar{1%tsp}.

Scatter @Thai chiles{3}(crushed) and @cilantro{1/4%cup} over @&(~1)soup{}.
